                                                "sense_id": "30316cb0-9e7b-3d8d-ba52-3ae9b9b443fc",
                                                "text": "Don’t get brassy with me, young lady!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d760c3ab-7f2e-49a7-95f0-01a50fac57c0",
                                                "sense_id": "30316cb0-9e7b-3d8d-ba52-3ae9b9b443fc",
                                                "text": "There's more than one way to declare independence, after all, and whereas Beyoncé announced hers with a brassy single, Ashanti tucks a similar spirit into every not-quite-heartbroken lyric."
                                            }
